[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0010","text":"那么，智代子队员，请汇报成果！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0020","text":"是！\n零食组，成功采购到了零食！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0030","text":"甜的……\n咸的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0040","text":"都准备了……很多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0050","text":"哦\n想得真周到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0060","text":"我们装饰组也\n顺利采购到了道具！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0070","text":"有可爱的\n也有吓人的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0080","text":"吓、吓人的，是什么程度的……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0090","text":"只是装饰事务所用的程度啦\n就是幽灵啊蝙蝠啊之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_03_0100","text":"呵呵，没有真正吓人的东西\n放心好了"}]
